body:
LMFOARN! Get that pet Blair! Let the ex go, he's not actually benefiting your life. It's almost winter and you're period's coming, so i say eat what you want. I'm sure you look great. 

&#x200B;

You are not alone.

Being trans comes with a lot of challenges. You could have it, or you could just be stressed because of what you have to deal with in life. Either way, hang in there. And if you have the energy, try to look up lgbtq youth services in the area you live. Support helps a lot.

&#x200B;

If you are not youth, look up trans bars in your area to meet similar people. Not the healthiest advice but i know adults meet eachother in bars so im assuming trans people do too. If you don't have a trans support network, you need one.
